                                "example_id": "93cfa51a-0e7e-406b-bde3-e54a1286dc08",
                                "sense_id": "cbfb3098-d255-3012-b188-4b68d16e2148",
                                "text": "Она́ так себя́ держа́ла, что ка́ждый челове́к, не обину́ясь, выска́зывал пе́ред ней свои́ мне́ния.",
                                "translation": "Her manner was such that people never hesitated to say what they thought in front of her.",
                                "english": "Her manner was such that people never hesitated to say what they thought in front of her."
